(7803240, 1302047, 772, '<td valign="top">
I didn''t find a whole lot of creativity in this challenge.  This photo, however, landed in my best of show category.  Just being able to notice this scene and having the ability to capture it so nicely is the mark of a good photographer :)  This photo hits upon quite a few characteristics that I look for in great images.  The strong interaction of shapes and symmetry is dominating this scene while the chaos of the web and water droplets creates a fascination and imbalance to add so much more interest... great shot!</td>', 'I didn''t find a whole lot of creativity in this challenge.  This photo, however, landed in my best of show category.  Just being able to notice this scene and having the ability to capture it so nicely is the mark of a good photographer :)  This photo hits upon quite a few characteristics that I look for in great images.  The strong interaction of shapes and symmetry is dominating this scene while the chaos of the web and water droplets creates a fascination and imbalance to add so much more interest... great shot!', '2025-11-27 05:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
