(7803524, 1302102, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Love the detail in this shot. It''s a thoughtful subject, and the use of backlighting is a key composition choice, so it gets a bump from me for this challenge.
<br/>
<br/>One nit: I do wish that the lid of the jar was turned just a little more counter-clockwise so that the metal clamp obscured less of the subject and its out-of-focus-ness felt less accidental.</td>', 'Love the detail in this shot. It''s a thoughtful subject, and the use of backlighting is a key composition choice, so it gets a bump from me for this challenge.

One nit: I do wish that the lid of the jar was turned just a little more counter-clockwise so that the metal clamp obscured less of the subject and its out-of-focus-ness felt less accidental.', '2025-12-01 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7803526, 1301898, 12200, '<td valign="top">
