For your next in this series, maybe try having the one on the right be almost full and the one on the left be almost empty...and then have the water levels across all three form an almost perfect horizontal line. (That''s where my brain immediately went, anyway...)', '2025-12-01 10:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
